{"engine":"Windows.Media.Ocr en-US","scale":3,"pages":[{"page":1,"width":2448,"height":3168,"lines":[{"text":"OFFICE OF","x":631,"y":278,"w":238,"h":37},{"text":"ASSESSOR-COUNTY CLERK-","x":630,"y":341,"w":657,"h":48},{"text":"RECORDER & ELECTIONS","x":631,"y":413,"w":581,"h":47},{"text":"COUNTY OF SAN MATEO","x":631,"y":487,"w":536,"h":37},{"text":"MARK CHURCH","x":1662,"y":334,"w":360,"h":44},{"text":"CHIEF ELECTIONS OFFICER &","x":1601,"y":392,"w":483,"h":34},{"text":"ASSESSOR-COUNTY CLERK-RECORDER","x":1527,"y":438,"w":633,"h":33},{"text":"Ballot Measure Rebuttal Argument Submission Form","x":576,"y":610,"w":1307,"h":53},{"text":"If both an argument in favor of and an argument against a measure have been selected for publication in the Sample","x":256,"y":688,"w":1924,"h":42},{"text":"Ballot & Official Voter Information Pamphlet, a typed rebuttal to the argument in favor of or the argument against the","x":256,"y":732,"w":1917,"h":42},{"text":"measure may be submitted as outlined in this form.","x":255,"y":776,"w":843,"h":37},{"text":"The author(s) of the primary argument of the measure may prepare and submit a rebuttal argument or may authorize","x":254,"y":847,"w":1928,"h":43},{"text":"in writing any other person or persons to prepare, submit or sign the rebuttal argument.","x":255,"y":890,"w":1432,"h":40},{"text":"A rebuttal argument will not be accepted unless accompanied by this completed form, which shall contain the printed","x":253,"y":962,"w":1925,"h":42},{"text":"name(s) and signature(s) of the person(s) submitting it or, if submitted on behalf of a bona fide association of citizens,","x":255,"y":1005,"w":1937,"h":41},{"text":"the name of the association and the printed name and signature of at least one of its principal officers. Please make","x":253,"y":1049,"w":1929,"h":41},{"text":"sure you are using proper format before submitting to the Elections Office.","x":254,"y":1094,"w":1327,"h":39},{"text":"Word count limit for Rebuttal Arguments = 250 wor